<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Utilities cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Utilities cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney confirmed that it cut its rating on Texas Utilities Co to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
